      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've seen people get frustrated by this countless times. Especially for more casual users who are online less often, since they often have to deal with figuring out what credentials they used, mixed with confusion about native and platform-linked accounts. I think the draconian session restrictions really contribute to the friction of using VRC.",
