      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have a reasonably static IP address, I logged into VRChat with a user account to do some world testing, possibly a month ago. The website does log me out occasionally. I think I've had to log back into Canny once or twice in the entire time I've participated here. \n\nBasically I agree with the suspicion that VRChat is overly picky about IP addresses.",
