      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Is this ever going to get fixed? It feels like any time I play the game in not the exact circumstances I had before, I need to \n\nType in my username\n\nFind my password\n\nSign into my email\n\nDo 2 factor authentication for my email\n\nFinally get into my email\n\nFind the email with the verification code from vrchat\n\ntype it into vrchat\n\nfinally log into vrchat\n\nit takes way too long. Can we at least turn off two factor authentication? Can you just leave us logged in? Is someone stealing my headset really that big of a fear?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
