  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-09-09T16:57:53.062Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "For the past 6 months, I’ve been getting logged out of VRChat multiple times a day, across pretty much everything:  \n\n- VRChat Client  \n\n- Browser  \n\n- SDK  \n\n- Canny  \n\n- Mobile apps  \n\nThe only thing that stays logged in is VRCX. (Third Party)\n\nThis started happening when I switched internet providers, so I’m guessing it’s something to do with changing IPs. I also get logged out whenever I use a VPN, even when the server is in the same city.\n\nVRChat logs me out more often than my bank or other services I use.\n\nThis also seems to be rather widespread since its also happening daily to a couple of friends.\n\nSuper annoying.",
